 "description": "Clickable. Use for choices the user makes: toggling an issue on or off, picking a filter, or removing an applied filter with the x. Off is outlined, on is filled navy. For a single choice from a set, put chips in a Chip group. Chips are never used for status; use a Pill for that.",
